---
description: Best practices for code formatting with Prettier (v3)
globs: **/*.ts,**/*.html,**/*.scss
---

- Use Prettier for consistent, opinionated formatting across the repo
- Configure `.prettierrc` for project conventions; keep rules minimal
- Integrate with ESLint via `eslint-config-prettier` to avoid conflicts
- Use `.prettierignore` to exclude build artifacts and generated files
- Run Prettier in CI to ensure formatting consistency

